					"speakerTitle": "泽维尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 30300623,
					"content": "我知道这个词在稻妻一般指那些特立独行、衣饰特殊的人，倒是一直想见见配得上这个说辞的人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30300624
					],
					"speakerTitle": "泽维尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 30300624,
					"content": "但很可惜，既没见过这类人，也没在与踏鞴砂有关的说法里听过相关事宜。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30300625
					],
					"speakerTitle": "泽维尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 30300625,
					"content": "（没有倾奇者…难道说散兵在世界树里做了什么，成功抹去了有关自己的记录？）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30300626
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 30300626,
					"content": "（如果是那样，他应该是想改变世界，让一切回到原点吧。但是，目前看来所有影响只跟他自己有关？）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30300627
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 30300627,
					"content": "谢谢你，泽维尔。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30300628
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 30300628,
					"content": "没什么，不用客气。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30300629
					],
					"speakerTitle": "泽维尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 30300629,
					"content": "要走了吗？那再见啦泽维尔！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30300630
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 30300630,
					"content": "噢！不必客气，我能帮上忙就好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30300631
					],
					"speakerTitle": "泽维尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 30300631,
					"content": "那就再会了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30300632
					],
					"speakerTitle": "泽维尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 30300632,
					"content": "看来，你想问的事都打听到了呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30300633
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 30300633,
					"content": "回去见小吉祥草王吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30300634
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 30300634,
					"content": "好啊，不过，不知道你今天到底怎么了…看上去心事重重的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30300635
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 30300635,
					"content": "打起精神来呀！无论发生什么我都会陪着你的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30300636,
						30300638
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 30300636,
					"content": "…嗯。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30300637
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 30300637,
					"content": "要振作哦，不行的话就吃点东西！空腹的人无法战胜生活！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30300640
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 30300640,
					"content": "那么，出发去见纳西妲吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 30300638,
					"content": "谢谢你，派蒙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30300639
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 30300639,
					"content": "我们之间客气什么嘛，嘿嘿。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30300640
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 303010,
